{"Lithuanian messages_lt.properties files (login and account) have totpStep1/loginTotpStep1 translations replaced with Italian text instead of Lithuanian": 0.9961950778961182, "Simplified Chinese messages_zh_CN.properties (account) uses Traditional Chinese characters for totpStep1 instead of Simplified Chinese characters": 0.9761056303977966, "VerifyMessageProperties.santizeAnchors() mutates the input string while iterating a Matcher created from the original string, so anchor tags may be skipped or not removed/validated consistently, causing false 'Illegal HTML' failures or missing mismatched anchor tags": 0.8328092694282532, "In verifySafeHtml(), the start and end counters that trim matching prefix/suffix can overlap on the shorter string, causing StringIndexOutOfBoundsException when start > sanitized.length() - end": 0.710630476474762, "verifySafeHtml() throws RuntimeException on IOException, but verify() only catches IOException, so RuntimeException propagates uncaught bypassing proper MojoExecutionException wrapping": 0.9339964389801025, "englishFile path construction uses replaceAll instead of replaceFirst for locale suffix regex, potentially corrupting the path if directory names contain _XX.properties-like segments": 0.6297256946563721}